              <div class="mt-1 h-1 w-12 bg-accent-500"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-industrial-300 mb-4">Sistema completo de gestão para restaurantes que revoluciona sua operação.</p>
            <div class="flex space-x-4">
              <a href="#" class="text-industrial-300 hover:text-white transition">Facebook</a>
              <a href="#" class="text-industrial-300 hover:text-white transition">Instagram</a>
              <a href="#" class="text-industrial-300 hover:text-white transition">LinkedIn</a>
